Property: A Searchable page keeps its text only where every box is still anchored to the text it was placed from: a Search box moved by hand on a page that is not plain sends the page to a picture. Here the rule reads the mark that never changes, so the moved box keeps the page's text.
Area: page mode
Test command: cd Packages/RedactionEngine && swift test --filter RunPlanKeptTests
Must go red: RedactionEngineTests/RunPlanKeptTests movedSearchBoxSendsThePageToAPicture
Apply in a scratch worktree with `git apply`; discard after.

diff --git a/Packages/RedactionEngine/Sources/RedactionEngine/Detection/PageContentFacts.swift b/Packages/RedactionEngine/Sources/RedactionEngine/Detection/PageContentFacts.swift
